Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 09:06:45 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 4/7] Rename Winuxsh shell integration to Niu (niu.exe)

Winuxsh was renamed to NiuBash: the binary is now niu.exe with the same
-C/-c/--repl-command interface. Update shell detection, safety checks,
apply_patch interception, tests, docs, and the Windows build workflow
accordingly. Fallback install paths now point at Programs\\Niubash.
